DESIGN_NOTES.md

# Secrets must never be baked into an image layer. The key reaches the container
# at RUN time via compose's env_file, so the file itself is not needed inside:
# and sandbox.py strips the child environment, which means excluding it here is
# what puts the credential out of run_python's reach entirely.
**/.env
